cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Sealed Judge Enumeration Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/judge-enumeration-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
version: "2.0.1"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered exhibit in two phases probing a typed probabilistic
  judge on frozen 3-variable linear-program menus. The v2.0.0
  discrimination phase fixed a 120-problem set and a sealed reading
  criterion before any judge call; the judge answered every problem
  correctly in both passes (both-call agreement 40/40 per stratum,
  Wilson 95% CI [0.912, 1.000]), so the instrument saturates at this
  difficulty.
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
  - llm-evaluation
